[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9245.99, "timestamp": "02:34:05", "text": "所以，我所在的研究所是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9248.23, "timestamp": "02:34:08", "text": "不仅帮助那些想要帮助的学生，也帮助那些想要帮助的学生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9250.63, "timestamp": "02:34:10", "text": "去那里的人，以及那些只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9253.429, "timestamp": "02:34:13", "text": "想去那里工作等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9261.11, "timestamp": "02:34:21", "text": "真好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9263.91, "timestamp": "02:34:23", "text": "就像这六个人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9267.429, "timestamp": "02:34:27", "text": "本地工作。是的。是的。他确实有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9271.11, "timestamp": "02:34:31", "text": "是的。是的。是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9278.389, "timestamp": "02:34:38", "text": "对，就是这个问题。这就是原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9281.59, "timestamp": "02:34:41", "text": "所以今天在课堂上，濑野是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9283.67, "timestamp": "02:34:43", "text": "比如，“好的，你可以挂断电话了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9285.59, "timestamp": "02:34:45", "text": "没必要来这里。我们会和……谈谈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9290.95, "timestamp": "02:34:50", "text": "其他需要去的学生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9294.07, "timestamp": "02:34:54", "text": "在日本，像上大学一样学习和生活。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9295.59, "timestamp": "02:34:55", "text": "东西"}]